<div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-3 content-heading mb-4"><div><h1>Financial Year</h1><p>Create and close accounting periods.</p></div><button class="btn text-white" style="background:var(--brand)" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#new-financial-year"><i class="bi bi-plus-circle me-1"></i>Create Financial Year</button></div>
